Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dumpster and portable toilet rental companies around {City}. I couldn't find {Business Name}'s sizes, rules or a way to book a drop-off date online, which is what homeowners and builders look for first.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a dumpster size picker by project, an order page with a drop-off date, a what-can-go-in-it page, driveway placement notes and a builder account section for jobsite restrooms, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
